>
>What are AD_SAMU attacks?  And who has them?

Attacks whose damage type is "amulet theft". These are treated as doing
physical damage, with a one in 20 chance of stealing a plot token if the
player has any.

The plot tokens, in descending priority order for theft, are:
  the Amulet of Yendor
  your Quest Artifact
  the Bell of Opening
  the Book of the Dead
  the Candelabrum of Invocation

AD_SAMU attacks are possessed by the Quest Nemesis (and, in one peculiar
case, the Quest Leader, but you should never have to deal with *that*
fact) and by the Wizard of Yendor.
